// Public configuration only. Replace this sentinel with the base64 SUPublicEDKey printed by
// Sparkle's generate_keys tool, then review and commit that public key. The matching private seed
// belongs in the release environment secret SPARKLE_ED25519_PRIVATE_KEY and never in this file.
// AppUpdateConfiguration and the release workflow reject this sentinel, malformed keys, and
// non-HTTPS feeds instead of starting an updater without a complete trust configuration.
ISLET_UPDATE_PUBLIC_ED_KEY = CONFIGURATION_REQUIRED
